    <string name="carlink_f150_share_log">Share connection log</string>
    <string name="carlink_f150_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="carlink_f150_credits">Built from CarLink by F-e-n-y-x and DiPlay by shihabal3amri, based on xcertplay by shilapi. Earlier CarLink work also incorporated DiAuto and Open Headunit. Original licenses and credits are preserved in the source. CarPlay belongs to Apple; this project is independent and uses experimental CarPlay support.</string>
